44652::$$$message_0385_0000_0000$$$::"Did you see that? This is true art, a sword dance performed by the ultimate thespian! [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーext face=ぐぬぬ pos=winner time=300 textclear=0][hfsweat layer=2 ox=-140 oy=50][hfangry layer=2]I'll have you know that my handicrafts sold quite well! Really!"::

